/	PROGRAM TO ADD TWO NUMBERS TOGETHER
/	HALTS WITH ACCUMULATOR (AC) CONTAINING
/	THE SUM OF THE TWO NUMBERS.

FOO,	CLA			/CLEAR THE AC
	TAD	A		/GET THE FIRST NUMBER
	TAD	B		/ADD ON THE SECOND NUMBER
	HLT			/STOP TO SHOW THE WORLD THE SUM!!!!

/	VARIABLES FOLLOW.

A,	1			/FIRST VARIABLE, INITIALIZED TO ONE
B,	2			/SECOND VARIABLE, INITIALIZED TO TWO
